# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mobile app environment — copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in.
#
# ONLY client-safe values belong here. Anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is
# compiled into the app and readable by anyone who has it.
#
# NEVER put these in this file or anywhere in /mobile:
#   - the Supabase service_role / secret key
#   - OpenAI / Anthropic / any AI provider key
#   - database passwords or any other server secret
# Server secrets live only in Supabase Edge Function secrets (see
# supabase/functions/README.md).
#
# Read by mobile/services/supabaseClient.ts. Setup: docs/SUPABASE_SETUP.md.
# (The mobile Phase 1 port adds EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_MODE=production|demo — see
# docs/PHASE1_BACKEND_INTEGRATION.md.)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → Data API → Project URL,
# e.g. https://abcdefghijklmnop.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API Keys → Publishable key
# (sb_publishable_…) or the legacy "anon public" key. Safe to ship: Row Level
# Security protects every table and file.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
